      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "AND PURSUANT TO the Rules of the DIFC Courts (the \"RDC\")",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "IT IS HEREBY ORDERED THAT the Defendant is to pay the Claimant the sum of AED 60,000 by 15",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
