    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCHEDULE OF REASONS",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. By the Order with Reasons dated 16 October 2025, the Defendant was ordered to pay the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Claimant's costs of the Permission to Appeal Application and the Application. Further, the Claimant",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "was ordered to file and serve a Statement of Costs and any short submissions in support of the costs",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "claimed within 21 days of the date of the Order.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. Pursuant to the RDC:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(a) It is the duty of the parties and their legal representatives to assist the Judge in making an",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "immediate assessment of costs in any cause to which RDC 38.30 applies (RDC 38.33);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(b) Each party who intends to claim costs must prepare a written statement of the costs he intends",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "to claim showing separately in the form of a schedule:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "i. The number of hours to be claimed;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "ii. The hourly rate to be claimed;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "iii. The qualifications and seniority of fee earner;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "iv. The amount and nature of any disbursement to be claimed;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "v. The amount of the legal representative's costs to be claimed for attending or appearing at",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the hearing; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "vi. Any tax to be claimed on these amounts (RDC 38.34); and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(c) The statement of costs should follow as closely as possible Form P38/01 and must be signed",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "by the party or his legal representative (RDC 38.35);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(d) The failure by a party, without reasonable excuse, to comply with RDC 38.33 to RDC 38.36 will",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "be taken into account by the Court in deciding what order to make about the costs of the claim,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p2-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "hearing or application, and about the costs of any further hearing or detailed assessment hearing",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "that may be necessary s a result of that failure (RDC 38.37).",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "3. The Claimant's statement of costs:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(a) Identifies a series of hourly rates for different categories of fee-earner ranging from AED 1000",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "to AED 3000 per hour;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(b) Put forward a cost schedule totalling AED 153,380 made up as to:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "i. AED 60,000 for the September Invoice (Appeal);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "ii. AED 28,794 for the October invoice (Appeal);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "iiI. AED 16,132 for the November invoice (Appeal);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "iv. AED 20,000 for External Counsel Fee (Appeal);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "v. AED 774.50 for application fees;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "vi. AED 20,000 for Enforcement (Fixed Fee);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "vii. AED 5,000 for Dubai Court Enforcement Fee;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "viii. AED 2,680 for translation of orders; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(c) Contains a note saying that all amounts were exclusive of VAT and a further note stating that",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "the Claimant's fees for enforcement were charged on a fixed fee basis.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "4. The Claimant's submissions in support of the application:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(a) Asserted that the costs should be assessed on the indemnity basis;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(b) Stated:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "i. that the Claimant was represented pursuant to a legal fee agreement entered into in",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "September 2025 specifically for the appeal proceedings:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "ii. That the legal fees were to be charged on an hourly basis relative to the fee earner",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "providing the service with a monthly aggregate cap of AED 60,000; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "iii. That external counsel fees of AED 20,o00 were also incurred in relation to the skeleton",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "argument.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "5. The Defendant submitted:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(a) That the Claimant should not be awarded any costs as it had not submitted a statement of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "costs which complied with the RDC which hampered the Court from making an assessment;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(b) That the Statement of Costs was not in form P38/01 and did not follow the form as closely as",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "possible;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(c) That the Statement failed to particularise the number of hours claimed by each fee earner and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p3-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "failed to set out the qualifications and seniority of each fee earner;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(d) That the form was not signed by the Claimant or its legal representatives;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(e) That some of the costs claimed did not relate to the application and others were very difficult to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "understand in relation to the November invoice; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(f) There was no basis for an assessment on an indemnity basis.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "6. In Reply, the Claimant asserted:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(a) That the statement of costs was signed electronically;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(b) That the Defendant's submissions ignored the commercial fee structure agreed;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(c) That the Claimant did follow Form P38/01 as closely as possible;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(d) That the Claimant was entitled to claim for enforcement costs and the November costs related",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "to the filing of the present application; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(e) That there was no duplication of effort.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "7. I consider that there is substantial force in relation to the Defendant's criticisms of the Claimant's",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "statement of costs. In particular, there is no identification of what hours were spent by what fee-earner",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "in what period on what tasks. I do not consider the fact that there was a capped fee to be relevant to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "this failing. There would have been nothing to stop the Claimant identifying the total number of hours",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "as justifying a fee of, say, AED 75,000 but that it was capped at AED 60,000.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "8. I also consider that the Claimant is not entitled to recovery of the sums claimed as enforcement",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "fees. They simply do not fall within the scope of the order.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "9. I consider that the Claimant can be said to have signed the statement by submission electronically.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "10. The Claimant's failures means that the assessment of the appropriate fees is more difficult than it",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "should be. In the circumstances, I propose to allow the amount which I can be satisfied is due to the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "Claimant despite the unsatisfactory nature of the schedule of costs. It is very likely that the amount",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "would have been greater had a proper schedule been provided.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "11. That amount is AED 60,000 made up by rounding down the following totals;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(a) AED 20,000 for Counsel's fees for the skeleton argument which I consider reasonable:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(b) AED 774.50 for application fees;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(c) AED 35,517.60 for the September and October invoices being 40% of the amount claimed and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "reflecting the lack of detail;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "(d) AED 4,033 for the November invoice being 25% of the amount claimed, reflecting both the lack",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "of detail and the unsatisfactory nature of the costs submissions.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "12. This is also not a case where I consider it appropriate to award costs on an indemnity basis.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "Further as the basis of assessment only has limited effects, such an award would not have changed",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "62930da32fa3172edf2f2bbf3da268455bd99a7b5fab34d72358730d8cd5da30-p4-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "my assessment. The basis of costs sought does not justify failing to provide basic information",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    }
  ],
  "tables": []
}
